.TH start-registry-admin-reader-add 1  "add "
.SH NAME
start\-registry\-admin\-reader\-add \- Register a key that private s9pks can grant read access to
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-registry admin reader add\fR [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fILABEL\fR> <\fIKEY\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Register a key that private s9pks can grant read access to
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fILABEL\fR>
Label identifying the reader key
.TP
<\fIKEY\fR>
Ed25519 public key of the reader, in PEM or DER Base64 format
